  "description": "A modern .NET library for ONVIF-compliant IP cameras: device discovery, media profiles and RTSP URIs, OSD, PTZ with home and auxiliary commands, imaging with exposure, white balance, day/night and focus control, events (PullPoint with topic filters), device administration (users, network, NTP/DNS, time zone, scopes), analytics modules and rules with Profile M metadata, Profile G edge recordings, jobs and event search, and device I/O.",
